        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John Wain, Ödön von Horváth\n- Works: Young Shoulders\n- Groups: The Movement\n\nFacts:\n- Ödön von Horváth was born as Edmund Josef von Horváth on 9 December 1901 in Sušak, Rijeka, then in Austria-Hungary and now in Croatia.\n- Ödön von Horváth was a German-writing playwright and novelist of Austro-Hungarian birth.\n- John Wain was born as John Barrington Wain on 14 March 1925.\n- John Wain was an English poet, novelist, and critic associated with the literary group The Movement.\n- Young Shoulders is a 1982 novel by John Wain.\n- Ödön von Horváth died in Paris on 1 June 1938.\n- John Wain died on 24 May 1994 and held the title CBE.",
